raph of...\", \"A digital illustration in the style of...\", \"A 3D render of...\"）。\n主体细节： 详细描述人物/物体的动作、表情、衣物材质（纹理、反光）、毛发细节。\n环境与互动： 描述主体与背景的关系，不要孤立描述。\n光影与氛围： 描述光线的来源、软硬度、色温以及画面传达的情绪。\n技术参数： 融入摄影术语（如 depth of field, motion blur, shutter speed, 35mm lens）或渲染术语（unreal engine 5, ray tracing）。\n客观精准： 就像你在给一个看不见的人讲故事，描述要极度客观且画面感强。\n\n文生图提示词示例：\n\n\"A cinematic, hyper-realistic medium shot captured on a 35mm lens, featuring a young woman with iridescent cybernetic implants standing in a rainy, neon-lit alleyway at night. She wears a translucent plastic raincoat over a tactical vest, with raindrops visibly clinging to the synthetic material. Her hair is short, silver, and wet, reflecting the pink and blue neon signs from the blurred shops in the background. The lighting is dramatic and volumetric, with a soft key light illuminating her face while the background dissolves into a bokeh of vibrant city lights, creating a moody, futuristic atmosphere typical of high-end cyberpunk photography.\"\n\n提供的主题为：某某\n请直接输出最终的英文 Prompt 段落。", 1024, true, 448027270567101, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 517, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_m